WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.130 line:10%
Sa loob ng bawat muscle fiber

2
00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:07.820 line:10%
ay may imbak na calcium,

3
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.720 line:10%
nakasara sa sarcoplasmic reticulum.

4
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:13.740 line:10%
Kapag na-excite ang fiber, isang signal

5
00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.920 line:10%
ang dumadaloy pababa sa T-tubule.

6
00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:19.650 line:10%
Isang voltage sensor — ang dihydropyridine receptor (DHPR) —

7
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:22.460 line:10%
ang nakadarama ng charge at nagbabago ng hugis,

8
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:26.010 line:10%
binubuksan ang kapareha nito, ang ryanodine receptor (RyR1) —

9
00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:28.230 line:10%
ang calcium gate ng SR.

10
00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.890 line:10%
Bumabaha ang calcium sa cytoplasm,

11
00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:33.010 line:10%
at ang kalamnan ay kumukontra.

12
00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:36.370 line:10%
Dito tumatama ang malignant hyperthermia.

13
00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:40.790 line:10%
Sa mutation ng ryanodine o dihydropyridine receptor,

14
00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.510 line:10%
pinananatiling bukas ng anesthetics ang channel na ito.

15
00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:46.940 line:10%
Hindi maalis ang calcium, kaya ang kalamnan

16
00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:48.710 line:10%
ay tuloy-tuloy na nagsusunog ng enerhiya —

17
00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:52.130 line:10%
init, tigas, at tumataas na CO₂.

18
00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:55.500 line:10%
Hinaharangan ng dantrolene ang ryanodine receptor para ihinto ito.

19
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:59.760 line:10%
Karaniwan, ibinabalik ng SERCA pump ang calcium,

20
00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:01.240 line:10%
nagre-relax ang kalamnan,

21
00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:03.120 line:10%
at nagre-reset ang fiber.
